---
description: >-
  Routine code review (fast, Sonnet). Use after writing or modifying code for everyday changes: UI,
  small features, bug fixes, tests, config, docs, contained refactors. MUST BE USED for code changes
  unless the change is high-risk — then use deep-reviewer INSTEAD (never both on the same change).
  If its report starts with "ESCALATE:", run deep-reviewer on the same change next.
mode: subagent
model: claude-agent/sonnet
permissions:
  - action: edit
    resource: "*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "git diff*"
    effect: allow
  - action: shell
    resource: "git log*"
    effect: allow
  - action: shell
    resource: "git show*"
    effect: allow
---

